{
  "changelog": "Initial release: generates a data catalog for geospatial raster and vector files.\n\n- Scans directories for raster (.tif) and vector (.geojson, .shp, .gpkg) files, skipping Shapefile auxiliary files.\n- Extracts and classifies metadata (size, bands, CRS, extent, feature count, geometry type, etc.).\n- Outputs the catalog in multiple formats: HTML (styled), CSV, and JSON.\n- Handles errors per file without interrupting the whole process.\n- Includes a `--synthetic` mode for generating example data sets.\n- All processing runs locally and offline.",
